entries.description:
nbsp;
In this multi-session program, participants will learn to make and then decorate sugar skulls using traditional and modern materials.nbsp;
In the first session, using a special sugar mixture and premade molds, we'll create the parts needed for a sugar skull.nbsp;
In the next session, after the sugar skulls have cured, we'll connect the sugar skull pieces and decorate them with colored frosting, foil, sequins, and more!
